  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-mode=\"public\" data-zone=\"topics\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Marshall McLuhan — CANOPTICON</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"McLuhan was an environmental thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about media as environments.1. McLuhan has very little to say about ecological environmentalism per se..\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500;1,6..72,600&display=swap\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=bos3ko\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\">CANOPTICON<span class=\"dot\">·</span><span class=\"wordmark-sub\">The standing record</span></a>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-toggle\" />\n    <label for=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-burger\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span></span></label>\n    <div class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"/\">Record</a>\n      <a href=\"/investigations\">Investigations</a>\n      <a href=\"/watchlist\">Watchlist</a>\n      <a href=\"/method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"/search\" class=\"nav-search\"><span class=\"q\">/</span> ask the record</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"record-main\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"Marshall McLuhan\",\"url\":\"/s/marshall-mcluhan\",\"description\":\"McLuhan was an environmental thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about media as environments.. McLuhan has very little to say about ecological environmentalism per se.. McLuhan would approve.\",\"subjectOf\":[{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"McLuhan's work on media theory\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of Explorations in Communication\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of 'Acoustic Space'\",\"startDate\":\"1960\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of Gutenberg Galaxy\",\"startDate\":\"1962\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of The Gutenberg Galaxy\",\"startDate\":\"1962\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Publication of Understanding Media\",\"startDate\":\"1964\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Publication of The Medium is the Massage\",\"startDate\":\"1967\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of A Schoolman's Guide to Marshall McLuhan\",\"startDate\":\"1967-03-18\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Publication of War and Peace in the Global Village\",\"startDate\":\"1968\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of Through the Vanishing Point\",\"startDate\":\"1968\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of Counterblast\",\"startDate\":\"1969\"},{\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"publication of Culture Is Our Business\",\"startDate\":\"1970\"}]}</script>\n\n<article class=\"subject-page\">\n  \n  \n  \n  <header class=\"subject-head\">\n    <div class=\"stamp\">\n  <div class=\"stamp-top\"><span class=\"fileno\">FILE ON MARSHALL MCLUHAN</span><span class=\"kindchip\">Person</span></div>\n  <div class=\"stamp-body\">\n    <h1>Marshall McLuhan</h1>\n    <p class=\"desig\">McLuhan was an environmental thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about media as environments.<a class=\"qref\" href=\"/q/68274aad-8c0d-40eb-aa23-7dba008fb976\" title=\"McLuhan was an *environmental* thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about *media as environments*.\"><sup>1</sup></a>. McLuhan has very little to say about ecological environmentalism per se..</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stamp-foot\"><div class=\"coord\"><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#on-file\">9 SOURCES</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> <a class=\"jump\" href=\"#on-the-record\">12 DOCUMENTED FACTS</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> <a class=\"jump\" href=\"#disputed\">8 DISPUTED</a> <span class=\"sep\">·</span> OPENED 2026-07-22 <span class=\"sep\">·</span> UPDATED <span class=\"hi\">2026-07-23</span></div></div>\n</div>\n    \n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"subject-grid\">\n    <div class=\"subject-main\">\n      \n      <section id=\"on-the-record\" data-schema=\"ItemList\"><div class=\"sec-k\">On the record <a class=\"sec-standalone\" href=\"/profile/marshall-mcluhan\">see profile →</a></div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-fd040a9f-360c-41d9-8919-af7d14e0d061\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan was an environmental thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about media as environments.</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“McLuhan was an *environmental* thinker in the literal sense — his entire project is about *media as environments*.”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-a504db3d-15da-4e93-9f98-b314020e13cb\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan has very little to say about ecological environmentalism per se.</p></div>\n  \n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-9baba807-df9d-4326-ae0e-0e048a30c6f5\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan would approve.</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“McLuhan would approve.”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-ce2a00f1-6cd4-424c-96c2-dd3c28488b75\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">The McLuhan-citation industry captures the brand and loses the substance</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“it captures the brand and loses the substance”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-5a4ab823-42e2-42b9-8ac0-62e25318ee60\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">The &#39;we shape our tools&#39; line is from Culkin 1967</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“The &#39;we shape our tools&#39; line isn&#39;t even McLuhan&#39;s.”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-7bf6af9a-4485-47d4-872b-f129e430c5e1\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">the tetrad&#39;s fourth law is when a medium is pushed to its limits, it reverses into its opposite</p></div>\n  \n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-d5081c1e-0f27-4443-8f0d-5b0f0879192b\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan&#39;s work was published in 1968</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“Quoted in Stearn (1968, p. 272)”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-bf91c729-4ca7-418f-83d9-3c059d1512a6\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">the global village is not a peaceful unity</p></div>\n  \n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-e9681b7b-e30c-4b86-8d95-d4c301a0eb98\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan&#39;s work on media theory</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“McLuhan&#39;s actual argument is that institutions, as artefacts of Gutenberg organisation, are themselves the rear-view mirror”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-eb364505-4f9a-453e-974a-20a76326d0d7\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">Figure refers to something that jumps out at us</p></div>\n  \n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-0cfbbf68-6e40-4890-8b6e-bd925ccf121e\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">McLuhan&#39;s argument is that institutions are artefacts of Gutenberg organisation</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“institutions, as artefacts of Gutenberg organisation, are themselves the rear-view mirror”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div><div class=\"fact\" id=\"fact-02f017f7-745d-4abd-9e2f-bc07d8476b39\">\n  <div class=\"fact-line\"><p class=\"fact-text\">The medium is the message</p></div>\n  <details class=\"rcpt\">\n  <summary><span class=\"rdoc\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</span></summary>\n  <div class=\"rcpt-body\">\n    <div class=\"rcpt-q\">“&quot;The medium is the message.&quot;”</div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-src\"><span>SOURCE</span><a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-a93b-867d0dd1cddd-text-markdown\">Research Brief: A McLuhanesque Critique of Mark Carney</a><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span>stored copy on file</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rcpt-v\">VERIFIED — a word-for-word match in the stored source</div>\n  </div>\n</details>\n</div></section>\n      <section id=\"disputed\" data-schema=\"Claim\">\n<div class=\"sec-k\">Disputed — who says what, against what <a class=\"sec-standalone\" href=\"/ct/marshall-mcluhan\">see standalone →</a></div>\n<div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"every extension is also an amputation\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-8d640283-1141-461e-8468-f03a148be915-text-markdown\"># A Comprehensive Map of Marshall McLuhan&#39;s Thought: Concept ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"the global village produces tribal psychology at planetary scale\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-8d640283-1141-461e-8468-f03a148be915-text-markdown\"># A Comprehensive Map of Marshall McLuhan&#39;s Thought: Concept ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"The shift to voice-first communication is potentially traumatic for typographic minds.\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-1bc8df92-2858-4e4a-9a2b-94fbd8feaaff-text-markdown\">The Acoustic Return: A Research Pass on McLuhan, Voice Inter ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"Biofeedback is the construction of an artificial sensory channel\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Evidence balance +1.0 · weakly supported</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-50866223-8fbb-4819-be3d-d3beea645f55-text-markdown\">Deep Research Pass: &quot;The Medium Becomes the Ground&quot; ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"McLuhan&#39;s claims about language are foundational to his media theory\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Evidence balance +2.0 · weakly supported</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-50866223-8fbb-4819-be3d-d3beea645f55-text-markdown\">Deep Research Pass: &quot;The Medium Becomes the Ground&quot; ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"the tetrads are &quot;a means of focusing awareness on hidden or unobserved qualities in our culture and technology&quot;\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-af07b1cf-ff94-4a36-be38-b2e696b60a16-text-markdown\">The Examined Cognition: Substrates of Metacognition and Meth ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"the integration of (i) Lieberman&#39;s PFC–amygdala labeling circuit, (ii) Barkley&#39;s delayed inner-speech model of ADHD, and (iii) McLuhan&#39;s account of language as the originary autoamputating extension\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Wolf</b> · stance: pro\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-50866223-8fbb-4819-be3d-d3beea645f55-text-markdown\">Deep Research Pass: &quot;The Medium Becomes the Ground&quot; ↗</a>\n</div><div class=\"contested-card\">\n  <div class=\"contested-stamp\">Disputed</div>\n  <blockquote class=\"contested-quote\">\"the visual mind would find acoustic experience disorienting, vertiginous, even terrifying\"</blockquote>\n  <div class=\"contested-attribution\">\n    Asserted by <b>Marshall McLuhan</b> · stance: critical\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"contested-balance\">Stance attributed; balance unscored</div>\n  <a class=\"contested-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-1bc8df92-2858-4e4a-9a2b-94fbd8feaaff-text-markdown\">The Acoustic Return: A Research Pass on McLuhan, Voice Inter ↗</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n      <section id=\"timeline\" data-schema=\"Event\">\n  <div class=\"sec-k\">Timeline <a class=\"sec-standalone\" href=\"/t/marshall-mcluhan\">see standalone →</a></div>\n  <section data-schema=\"ItemList\" data-schema-item=\"Event\">\n  <div class=\"tl-rail\"><div class=\"tl-item\">\n  <div class=\"tl-when\">—</div>\n  <div class=\"tl-body\">\n    <div class=\"tl-label\">McLuhan&#39;s work on media theory</div>\n    <div class=\"tl-meta\"><a class=\"tl-receipt\" href=\"/q/a492233a-fc71-495f-bb6f-3410e46543b7\">receipt ↗</a> · <a class=\"tl-src\" href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-c62ae192-bf63-4c64-